WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.660
Harrow Viaduct.

00:01.600 --> 00:02.880
Here is what happened.

00:03.130 --> 00:08.860
Ivo Sandre, the conductor, countersigned brake certificates for carriage four after the Dunmore depot flooded.

00:08.800 --> 00:10.500
He never inspected a pad.

00:10.620 --> 00:12.620
Ansel Corbin found the forgery.

00:12.560 --> 00:17.150
At ten to midnight he left a voicemail, promising to name the signer at Lorne.

00:17.090 --> 00:20.500
At Gram, Ivo carried Doctor Pell's bag and took a strip of somnex.

00:21.040 --> 00:26.380
At the pantry hatch, while Tilda fetched honey, he crushed the tablets into Ansel's milk toddy.

00:26.320 --> 00:33.900
At a quarter past two, with the train on the viaduct, Ivo walked the drowsy auditor to the door between cars four and five.

00:33.840 --> 00:37.420
He opened it with his own card, and he pushed.

00:37.360 --> 00:40.300
A brass button tore from his cuff and stayed on the floor.

00:40.240 --> 00:43.180
He relocked the door and went back to the guard van.

00:43.120 --> 00:46.570
In cabin seven, three people heard only the wind.
